Retail Sales Analysis

Project Overview

Retail Sales Analysis is a data analytics project developed using Microsoft Excel and Power BI. The project focuses on analyzing retail sales data and presenting important business insights through an interactive dashboard.

Objectives

- Analyze retail sales performance
- Track sales, quantity, profit, and orders
- Present data using interactive visualizations
- Use slicers to filter and explore the data
- Create an easy-to-understand Power BI dashboard

Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Excel
- Power BI

Project Files

- "supermarket sales analysis.xlsx" – Excel dataset used for analysis
- "Retail Sales Analysis.pbix" – Power BI dashboard file
- "Dashboard.png.png" – Dashboard screenshot
- "Project Report.docx" – Project report

Dashboard

The Power BI dashboard provides interactive visualizations for analyzing sales, quantity, profit, and orders. Slicers can be used to filter and explore the data.

Outcome

This project demonstrates the use of Excel and Power BI for data analysis, visualization, and dashboard development.